# AltarDoorController (32051): talking to the altar door keeper shows nothing, its first talk
# returning no page: the action's ActionFailed, then the empty first talk's.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.AltarDoorController
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
npc altar 32051 Folk 40 0 0

action altar
action altar
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
